# TAi reads its settings from the environment of the orchestrator and from this .env file.
# Every setting this fork adds is listed, with its default, in docs/SETTINGS.md
# (the student page: docs/PORTAL.md; voice calls: docs/VOICE.md; notifications: docs/NOTIFICATIONS.md).
# On the course's host, deploy/cs6650/tai_credentials.sh asks for each key without echoing it and writes it there;
# no key belongs in git.
